  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1601.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1601.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to prevent, abate, and control pollutants emitted into the ambient air by controlling the use of fuels containing specific pollutant elements and compounds, pursuant to RSA 125-C:6, II.\n\nSource. #6519-B, eff 5-29-97 (from Env-A 401); ss by #8330, eff 4-23-05; ss by #10415, eff 9-24-13; ss by #13808, eff 11-18-23",
